# Dev Validation Lab EPS Guardrail

This rule is mandatory.

Whenever modifying any of the following:

- app/dev_validation_lab/**
- tests/**
- Stream Runtime
- Seeder
- Throughput Config
- Visible E2E Seed
- WireMock mappings

You MUST preserve the E2E throughput of every DEV VALIDATION and DEV E2E stream.

Requirements:

- Every E2E stream must continuously maintain an expected throughput between 5 and 20 EPS.
- Never reduce any E2E stream below 5 EPS.
- Never increase any E2E stream above 20 EPS.
- Do not hardcode batch sizes that reduce throughput.
- If any code change breaks the EPS range, the task is considered failed.

Before completing the task you MUST verify:

- tests/test_lab_throughput_config.py
- tests/test_dev_validation_lab.py
- tests/test_visible_e2e_seed.py

Do not finish the task until every E2E stream still satisfies the 5~20 EPS requirement.
